sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant U as unary()
participant D as CusumDetector
U->>D: construct fresh instance
loop each finite value
    U->>D: update(value)
    D->>D: validate value and finite first difference
    alt first point or reference warmup
        Note over D: Retain previous level / reference delta
        D-->>U: 0.0, ready=false
    else reference ready
        Note over D: Expired non-suspect delta can enter reference
        Note over D: Append pending delta, compute noise_std and background_level
        alt pending window incomplete
            D-->>U: 0.0, ready=false
        else window ready
            Note over D: Positive and negative CUSUM peaks produce noise_score
            Note over D: Relative up/down mass produces inertia_score
            Note over D: Quarantine suspect pending deltas from reference
            D-->>U: noise_score * inertia_score
        end
    end
    Note over U: Read instance.ready, warmup becomes None
end
